ative: 13 duplicate keys\n\nTherefore diff on grouped granules, not raw rows.","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Production validation finding\n\nCurrent prod boost tables have physical duplicate rows per proposed key.\n\nExample duplicate check with run_id proxy:\nproducts: 33 duplicate keys\ncampaign: 1,833 duplicate keys\nadgroup: 27 duplicate keys\ncreative: 13 duplicate keys\n\nTherefore diff on grouped granules, not raw rows.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"box-example-correction","type":"rectangle","x":1780,"y":560,"width":520,"height":230,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#b91c1c","backgroundColor":"#fef2f2","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"aV","roundness":{"type":3},"seed":3007,"version":2,"versionNonce":991688266,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1780874592641,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"text-example-correction","type":"text","x":1802,"y":582,"width":470,"height":180,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#111827","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"aW","roundness":null,"seed":3008,"version":2,"versionNonce":226290518,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1780874592641,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Correction example\n\nOriginal ledger row observed 2026-06-05:\n+100.00 for granule G\n\nBug discovered 2026-06-20:\ncorrect value should have been +80.00\n\nAppend correction row:\n-20.00 observed 2026-06-20\n\nNever mutate invoiced history.","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Correction example\n\nOriginal ledger row observed 2026-06-05:\n+100.00 for granule G\n\nBug discovered 2026-06-20:\ncorrect value should have been +80.00\n\nAppend correction row:\n-20.00 observed 2026-06-20\n\nNever m