isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1780930930810,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"1a. We go from GCS directly to diff table.\n  - Doesn't work we need to scan throuhg all past snapshots in window which will be annoying if they are all s3 files and need to be kept in local memory\n1b. We have an intermediate BigQuery snapshot.\n  - If we change correct our diff logic it's easier for us to find the diff with past data and insert a correction row\n\n\n\nIf 1b\n    Do we have a separate \"manifest\" table to declare that a date is finished ingesting into BQ snapshot?\n        - How do we handle a day where there is only one past product purchase that got refunded = 0 rows\n    Do we want to have a separate GCS Pubsub for downstream trigger or just have temporal worker do coordination calls directly\n    Do we want to trigger next step after everything in current step is done\n    \n\n\nHow do we trigger diff table generation\n  - timed view generation\n  - Temporal worker after putting to bigquery manually triggers Dataform invocation\n    \n","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"1a. We go from GCS directly to diff table.\n  - Doesn't work we need to scan throuhg all past snapshots in window which will be annoying if they are all s3 files and need to be kept in local memory\n1b. We have an intermediate BigQuery snapshot.\n  - If we change correct our diff logic it's easier for us to find the diff with past data and insert a correction row\n\n\n\nIf 1b\n    Do we have a separate \"manifest\" table to declare that a date is finished ingesting into BQ snapshot?\n        - How do we handle a day where there is only one past product purchase that got refunded = 0 rows\n    Do we want to have a separate GCS Pubsub for downstream trigger or just have temporal worker do coordination calls directly\n    Do we want to trigger next step after everything in current step is done\n    \n\n\nHow do we trigger diff table generation\n  - timed view generation\n  - Temporal worker after putting to bigquery manually triggers Dataform invocation\n    \n","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"chKYErNLaVRnsAP5WSZ-o","type":"arrow","x":1640.3386262014772,"y":1450.9764914805155,"width":282.6227138482798,"height":10.054333920341378,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b08","roundness":null,"seed":1427474769,"version":49,"versionNonce":1388305311,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"cp3q9feGrfL9Lo6NojYBF"}],"updated":1780927354279,"link":null,"locked":false,"points":[[0,0],[-141.31135692414,0],[-141.31135692414,10.054333920341378],[-282.6227138482798,10.054333920341378]],"startBinding":{"elementId":"XyRr2xHry507PqxWmKftV","mode":"orbit","fixedPoint":[-0.02924193906648547,0.4291999849124616]},"endBinding":{"elementId":"7IWp4uQej8u-c86Natymx","mode":"orbit","fixedPoint":[1.0287313293965326,0.498796227927284]},"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","elbowed":true,"fixedSegments":null,"startIsSpecial":null,"endIsSpecial":null},{"id":"cp3q9feGrfL9Lo6NojYBF","type":"text","x":1471.0772952172786,"y":1443.5036584406862,"width":55.89994812011719,"height":25,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b09","roundness":null,"seed":74930417,"version":7,"versionNonce":796066321,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1780927353263,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Query","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"chKYErNLaVRnsAP5WSZ-o","originalText":"Query","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"ICKBn3cu0ZhTD4pVIHgnI","type":"rectangle","x":-1329.314058701919,"y":1554.4359290757734,"width":259.7631357658